{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [2]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place. [3]\n- **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Pipewell for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ce-7073-abc5-c06d72a600e5","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:05.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm multiple pipelines reporting","track deals multiple pipelines crm","multiple sales pipelines best practice"],"latency_ms":5120,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[179,187],[498,506]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[283,296],[523,536]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[361,374]],"pos":3,"recomm